# Normalize line endings.
#
# Git for Windows ships with core.autocrlf=true, which hands Windows clones a
# CRLF working tree. That breaks this repo under WSL/Linux: make chokes on \r
# in recipes, and shebang scripts fail with "bad interpreter: ...^M".
# Declaring it here fixes every clone without each person configuring anything.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets.
*.z64 binary
*.bin binary
*.o binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
*.so.* binary
*.elf binary
*.png binary
